<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cornĕus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		cornu. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of horn, horny, horn-</i> (rare but class.): corneo
			proceroque rostro (ibes), * <i><span class="en">Cic. N.
				D. 1, 36, 101</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 545</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 1, 697</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pyxis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 6, 39, § 142</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laterna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crater,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 32, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ungula (equi),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc. 6,
					83</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 9, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porta Somni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 894</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 5, 3,
			288</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Hard as horn, horny</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora piscatorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					31, 9, 45, § 102</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 19, 18,
				§ 80</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fibra,</span>”
				<i>hard-heartedness, insensibility</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					1, 47</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 4, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>Of the color of korn</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cereum aut corneum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 6, 23, § 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 8, 12, § 61</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. A. 6,
		894</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
